1
00:00:03,917 --> 00:00:05,397
-迪蘭 -鄧菲先生
- Dylan? - Oh, Mr. D.

2
00:00:05,397 --> 00:00:06,457
你也在這慢跑啊
You jog here, too?

3
00:00:06,457 --> 00:00:08,467
這離我們家就半個街區
I'm a half a block from my house.

4
00:00:08,467 --> 00:00:09,676
你穿靴子跑步嗎
Are you wearing boots?

5
00:00:09,676 --> 00:00:12,886
好吧 其實這并不是那么巧合啦
Okay, this is less of a coincidence than it seems.

6
00:00:12,886 --> 00:00:15,186
我跟了你好幾天了
I've been following you around for a few days.

7
00:00:15,186 --> 00:00:16,467
是關于海莉的事
It's about Haley.

8
00:00:16,556 --> 00:00:17,966
我知道她現在正在戀愛中
I know she's in a relationship,

9
00:00:17,966 --> 00:00:20,166
但是我愛她 我覺得她也愛我
but I love her, and I think she loves me.

10
00:00:20,166 --> 00:00:21,806
迪蘭 我聽說了發生的事
Dylan, I heard about what happened.

11
00:00:21,806 --> 00:00:23,126
要我就不會想太多
I wouldn't read too much into it.

12
00:00:23,126 --> 00:00:24,696
畢竟只是一個吻而已
It was only one kiss.

13
00:00:25,756 --> 00:00:26,977
不是吧
Oh, no.

14
00:00:27,496 --> 00:00:28,826
兩個吻嗎
Two kisses?

15
00:00:29,156 --> 00:00:30,066
你愿意這么想也行
Okay.

16
00:00:30,066 --> 00:00:31,966
我去了迪蘭家跟他說
I went to Dylan's house to tell him it wasn't okay

17
00:00:31,966 --> 00:00:34,516
我們不應該接吻 結果我和他睡了
that we kissed, and I ended up sleeping with him.

18
00:00:34,516 --> 00:00:36,416
我想回去告訴他我們不應該上床
I would go back to his house to tell him it wasn't okay

19
00:00:36,416 --> 00:00:38,446
但是誰知道那又會發生什么
we slept together, but where does that go?

20
00:00:39,496 --> 00:00:41,195
反正我就是想和她談一談
Anyway, I just want to talk to her,

21
00:00:41,195 --> 00:00:42,555
可是她不接我的電話
and she won't return my calls.

22
00:00:42,555 --> 00:00:43,796
她在跟你玩人間蒸發嗎
She's ghosting you?

23
00:00:43,885 --> 00:00:46,175
作為一個長輩 你總是這么跟得上流行
For an older dude, you always kept up with the lingo.

24
00:00:46,175 --> 00:00:47,116
是滴
Word.

25
00:00:47,695 --> 00:00:48,855
真為你難過 小伙子
Aw, I'm sorry, man.

26
00:00:48,855 --> 00:00:50,805
你是個好人 不應該被人間蒸發對待
You're a good guy. You deserve better than being ghosted.

27
00:00:50,805 --> 00:00:52,435
-我會跟她說一說的 -你愿意為我這樣做
- I'll talk to her. - You'd do that for me?

28
00:00:52,435 --> 00:00:54,665
對 我會跟她好好嘮嘮 頂我不
Yeah, I'll throw her a gab. You stab me?

29
00:00:55,355 --> 00:00:57,305
靠 盧克是不是亂教來整我了
Darn it. I think Luke's messing with me.

30
00:01:10,675 --> 00:01:11,615
媽媽咪呀
Mama mia!

31
00:01:11,615 --> 00:01:13,554
我的兒胳膊兒怎么兒了
What is-a wrong-a with-a my arm-a?

32
00:01:13,554 --> 00:01:14,754
別擔心
Fuggedaboutit!

33
00:01:14,754 --> 00:01:16,124
你滴胳膊好好的
Youse arm's fine!

34
00:01:16,124 --> 00:01:18,784
那你為啥兒不來咬一大兒口這多汁的美味
Ah, then why-a won't you take a big-a, juicy bite out of it?

35
00:01:18,784 --> 00:01:21,214
路易吉 我覺得我們
Yo, Luigi, I think what we got here

36
00:01:21,214 --> 00:01:23,194
交流有問題
is a communication problem.

37
00:01:23,194 --> 00:01:27,374
我說我想吃意式時 是指...
See, when I said I wanted to eat Italian...

38
00:01:27,864 --> 00:01:29,064
-落幕 -落幕
- And scene. - And scene.

39
00:01:29,064 --> 00:01:29,984
太好啦
Bravo!

40
00:01:29,984 --> 00:01:32,554
他們剛才是即興排出的戲
They just made that scene up as they were going,

41
00:01:32,554 --> 00:01:35,254
而且最后還有一個有趣的轉折
and then at the end, there was a funny twist.

42
00:01:35,254 --> 00:01:36,594
下一幕
Okay, for this next scene,

43
00:01:36,594 --> 00:01:38,274
雪莉會扮演一個名人
Sherry will play a famous person.

44
00:01:38,274 --> 00:01:39,734
演員盧·戴蒙德·菲利普斯
Lou Diamond Phillips!

45
00:01:39,734 --> 00:01:42,084
棒 杰 幫我想個職業[我需要找正職]
Excellent. And, Jay, I need an occupation.

46
00:01:42,084 --> 00:01:43,184
我同意
I agree.

47
00:01:43,313 --> 00:01:46,793
曼尼的虛幻加拿大女朋友竟然是真的
So, it turns out Manny's fake Canadian girlfriend is real

48
00:01:46,793 --> 00:01:48,203
還很煩人
and annoying.

49
00:01:48,393 --> 00:01:50,653
他回學校之前 她會一直住在這
Until he goes back to school, she's staying here

50
00:01:50,653 --> 00:01:53,123
一直試鏡 準備當個即興表演明星
and auditioning to be an improv star,

51
00:01:53,123 --> 00:01:56,103
就像那個誰 你知道的 沒誰
just like, you know, no one ever.

52
00:01:57,343 --> 00:01:59,623
天啊 夏天這么快就過去了
Boy, oh, boy, did that summer fly by or what?

53
00:01:59,623 --> 00:02:01,523
-不說了 你走吧 -拜 杰
- Anyway, off you go. - Bye, Jay.

54
00:02:01,523 --> 00:02:02,853
我已經開始想你了 寶貝
I miss already you, papi.

55
00:02:02,853 --> 00:02:05,233
他過三天就要回來洗臟衣服了
He'll be back in three days to do his laundry.

56
00:02:05,233 --> 00:02:06,173
我也會想你的
I'll miss you, too.

57
00:02:06,173 --> 00:02:07,354
過來 小泰迪熊
Come here, Teddy Bear.

58
00:02:07,943 --> 00:02:09,823
-周六見 -我等不及了
- See you Saturday. - I can't wait.

59
00:02:12,823 --> 00:02:15,422
好 我去樓上練習即興劇啦
Okay, I'll be upstairs, doing space work.

60
00:02:20,232 --> 00:02:22,482
歌洛莉亞 一個問題
Gloria, quick question --

61
00:02:22,482 --> 00:02:24,112
那個人怎么還在這
why is that person still here?

62
00:02:24,112 --> 00:02:26,282
我沒告訴你嗎
Ay! I didn't tell you?

63
00:02:26,282 --> 00:02:29,222
-你少來 -學校不讓雪莉
- Don't even. - The college won't let Sherry

64
00:02:29,222 --> 00:02:30,942
和曼尼一起住宿舍
live in the dorm with Manny,

65
00:02:30,942 --> 00:02:32,523
所以她要住在這里
so she's gonna stay here.

66
00:02:32,572 --> 00:02:35,242
我要做個美味的三明治啦 你來一個嗎
I am going to make a delicious sandwich. You want one?

67
00:02:35,242 --> 00:02:37,342
我不要什么三明治 我想讓她離開我們家
I don't want a sandwich. I want her out of my house.

68
00:02:37,342 --> 00:02:38,822
而且被你說得有點想吃三明治了
And I kind of want a sandwich.

69
00:02:38,822 --> 00:02:42,102
這是曼尼第一段正經感情
This is Manny's first serious relationship.

70
00:02:42,102 --> 00:02:43,192
我以前常常跟他說
I used to tell him,

71
00:02:43,192 --> 00:02:45,571
"我知道有一天你一定會找到這樣一個女人
"I know that one day you're gonna find a woman

72
00:02:45,571 --> 00:02:48,921
她會欣賞你的各種優點"
that will appreciate all your gifts."

73
00:02:48,921 --> 00:02:50,371
其實我也不知道
But I didn't know.

74
00:02:50,371 --> 00:02:52,411
你意思是你覺得她不煩人嗎
You're saying you don't find her annoying?

75
00:02:52,411 --> 00:02:54,781
不啊 我覺得她很搞笑 別擔心
No. I think she's funny. And don't worry.

76
00:02:54,781 --> 00:02:55,961
她就在這住到
She's only gonna stay here

77
00:02:55,961 --> 00:02:58,981
她可以靠即興表演養活自己的時候
until she can support herself doing improv.

78
00:02:58,981 --> 00:03:00,361
那把她的名字也加入我們家電話答錄機吧
Well, put her name on the answering machine,

79
00:03:00,361 --> 00:03:01,881
她這輩子估計都得住在這了
'cause she's not going anywhere.

80
00:03:01,881 --> 00:03:05,361
韋恩·布雷迪這樣的人一生頂多碰到一個
We're only lucky enough to get one Wayne Brady in a lifetime.

81
00:03:06,931 --> 00:03:09,371
我剛剛遇到迪蘭了
Hey. I just ran into Dylan.

82
00:03:09,371 --> 00:03:11,081
他告訴我你們之間怎么回事了
He told me what happened between you two.

83
00:03:11,081 --> 00:03:12,321
-聽著 不管他說了什么 -別緊張
- Look, whatever he said -- - Relax.

84
00:03:12,321 --> 00:03:13,902
我知道你又親了他
I know you kissed him again.

85
00:03:14,211 --> 00:03:14,941
可以這么說
Okay.

86
00:03:14,941 --> 00:03:15,881
你顯然繼承了
You clearly inherited

87
00:03:15,881 --> 00:03:17,690
我們鄧菲之吻的力量
the power of the Dunphy kiss.

88
00:03:17,690 --> 00:03:20,260
相信我 那真的能讓男人意亂情迷
Take it from me. That can really mess with a man.

89
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:21,830
你不能再對他玩人間蒸發了
You need to stop ghosting him.

90
00:03:21,950 --> 00:03:23,580
我知道 可是這太難了
I know. It's just so hard.

91
00:03:23,580 --> 00:03:24,870
我是說 我現在和阿爾文在一起
I mean, I'm with Arvin,

92
00:03:24,870 --> 00:03:26,550
我告訴他我吻了迪蘭后他就沒理過我
who hasn't talked to me since I told him I kissed Dylan,

93
00:03:26,550 --> 00:03:29,500
而每次我跟迪蘭談話 最后都... 吻了他
and every time I talk to Dylan, I end up...kissing him.

94
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,770
反正就是很混亂啦
It's very confusing.

95
00:03:30,770 --> 00:03:32,420
迪蘭是個內心敏感的人
Well, Dylan's a sensitive guy.

96
00:03:32,420 --> 00:03:34,050
你們一起經歷了那么多
After all your history together,

97
00:03:34,050 --> 00:03:35,610
他理應知道自己是什么身份
he deserves to know where he stands.

98
00:03:35,610 --> 00:03:36,730
你應該和他談談
You should talk to him.

99
00:03:36,730 --> 00:03:38,810
好吧 我讓他過來
Fine. I'll tell him to come over.

100
00:03:39,290 --> 00:03:41,180
用河豚表情
Use the blowfish emoji.

101
00:03:41,180 --> 00:03:43,070
意思是"準備迎接壞消息吧"
It means, "Brace yourself for some bad news."

102
00:03:43,070 --> 00:03:44,700
-不 不是那個意思 -盧克
- No, it doesn't. - Luke.

103
00:03:47,799 --> 00:03:48,569
不行 不行
Hey, hey, no, no.

104
00:03:48,569 --> 00:03:50,529
我說過今天不許再看視頻了 好嗎
I said no more screen time today, okay?

105
00:03:50,529 --> 00:03:52,349
再說了卡車視頻能有什么吸引人的
What's so fascinating about truck videos, anyway?

106
00:03:52,349 --> 00:03:53,489
惹火消防員呢
Ooh, firemen.

107
00:03:53,489 --> 00:03:54,939
好了 莉莉 我們走吧
All right, Lily, let's go.

108
00:03:54,939 --> 00:03:56,380
我們有多晚
Okay, how late are we --

109
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:57,629
"屋內丟羊"那種晚
"Goat loose in the house" Late

110
00:03:57,629 --> 00:03:58,799
還是"路中蠻牛"那種晚
or "Stubborn cow in the road" Late?

111
00:03:58,799 --> 00:04:01,419
你都在這住了二十年了 說人話行嗎
You've lived here 20 years. Please use city time.

112
00:04:01,419 --> 00:04:02,419
卡爾 卡爾 卡爾 卡爾
Oh, Cal, Cal, Cal, Cal!

113
00:04:02,419 --> 00:04:04,409
不要啊 你灑了一地
No, you're spilling all over the floor!

114
00:04:05,309 --> 00:04:06,879
莉莉 你走路能看看路嗎
Hey, Lily, can you watch where you're going?

115
00:04:06,879 --> 00:04:08,629
行 麻煩都賴我行了吧
Yeah, I'm the problem.

116
00:04:08,629 --> 00:04:10,089
現在我們得給他換鞋了
Now we're gonna have to change his shoes.

117
00:04:10,089 --> 00:04:11,329
不對 他不能穿其他鞋
No, he can't wear his other shoes

118
00:04:11,329 --> 00:04:12,819
因為他拿蠟筆在上面亂寫亂畫
because he scribbled on those in crayon

119
00:04:12,819 --> 00:04:15,139
看上去像納粹十字符一樣 在今天這個時代
and it looks like a swastika, and in this day and age...

120
00:04:15,139 --> 00:04:16,509
不僅僅是當今時代
Not just this day and age.

121
00:04:16,509 --> 00:04:18,738
行了 他的鞋沒事 他們也有孩子
Okay. His shoes are fine. They have kids.

122
00:04:18,738 --> 00:04:20,588
他們知道孩子會毀了一切
They know they ruin everything.

123
00:04:22,078 --> 00:04:23,639
-除了你的生活 -對
- Except your life. - Yeah.

124
00:04:23,828 --> 00:04:25,009
圓得不錯
Nice save.

125
00:04:25,028 --> 00:04:27,988
我們辦公室的另一個助理地檢 特倫特
Another Assistant District Attorney in my office, Trent,

126
00:04:27,988 --> 00:04:30,158
邀請我們共進午餐 這簡直太好了
invited us over for lunch, which is great

127
00:04:30,158 --> 00:04:32,628
因為他在找一個次席律師
because he is looking for a second chair

128
00:04:32,628 --> 00:04:36,238
一起處理一個受人矚目的案子 我想加入
on a very high-profile case, and I want in.

129
00:04:36,238 --> 00:04:38,138
知道嗎 我以前是蚱蜢高中
You know, I was second-chair washboard

130
00:04:38,138 --> 00:04:40,398
交響樂團的搓衣板次席
in the Grasshopper High School orchestra.

131
00:04:42,488 --> 00:04:43,048
你繼續
Go on.

132
00:04:43,048 --> 00:04:45,598
是這樣的 特蘭特和我有好多共同點
So, Trent and I have so much in common.

133
00:04:45,598 --> 00:04:47,998
他的丈夫也在學校工作 就像小卡一樣
His husband works in a school, just like Cam,

134
00:04:47,998 --> 00:04:49,638
他們也有兩個小孩
and they have two young kids.

135
00:04:49,638 --> 00:04:53,287
我的意思是 要是有個同志律師交友網
I mean, if there was a gay lawyer dating site,

136
00:04:53,287 --> 00:04:54,347
我們絕對能完美配對
we'd be a perfect match.

137
00:04:54,347 --> 00:04:56,857
那可以叫懸案[巨根]陪審團網
It could be called HungJuries.Com.

138
00:04:57,477 --> 00:05:00,087
行吧 走之前把這些爛哏都先說完
Good. So, get all that out before we go.

139
00:05:00,837 --> 00:05:03,257
歡迎 請進 你一定就是小卡了
Welcome. Come in. You must be Cam.

140
00:05:03,257 --> 00:05:04,187
-你好 -你好 我是特蘭特
- Hi. - Hi. I'm Trent.

141
00:05:04,187 --> 00:05:04,977
這是我的丈夫 基蘭
This is my husband -- Kieran.

142
00:05:04,977 --> 00:05:07,107
你好 很高興見到你們 這是莉莉和卡爾
Hi. Nice to meet you. This is Lily and Cal.

143
00:05:07,107 --> 00:05:08,217
不好意思我們遲到了
Sorry we're late.

144
00:05:08,217 --> 00:05:10,077
這倆個家伙在車上小吵小鬧了一陣兒
These two got into a little spat in the car,

145
00:05:10,077 --> 00:05:11,297
我們不得不靠邊停下車 所以
and we had to pull over, so...

146
00:05:11,297 --> 00:05:12,777
他朝我臉上打嗝
He burped in my face.

147
00:05:12,777 --> 00:05:14,037
誰讓你當時正看著我
You were looking at me.

148
00:05:14,037 --> 00:05:15,538
好了 好了 第二輪又來了
Great, great. Round 2.

149
00:05:16,147 --> 00:05:17,407
我相信你們懂的
I'm sure you guys get it.

150
00:05:17,407 --> 00:05:19,967
當然 我們的小家伙在車里更鬧騰
Oh, totally. Our little ones are even worse in the car.

151
00:05:19,967 --> 00:05:21,916
我去把他們帶過來讓孩子們一起玩
Oh, I'll go get them so the kids can play.

152
00:05:22,306 --> 00:05:24,926
你們的房子 可真是 真是 真漂亮
Wow. Your house, it's -- it's -- it's beautiful.

153
00:05:24,926 --> 00:05:27,186
而且 天啊 這個盤子太美了
And -- Oh, my God, this plate is gorgeous.

154
00:05:27,186 --> 00:05:28,726
謝謝夸獎 我們在尼泊爾
Oh, thank you. Yeah, we got that in Nepal

155
00:05:28,726 --> 00:05:31,126
一個童女神慶典節日上買的
at a festival celebrating the child goddess Kumari.

156
00:05:31,126 --> 00:05:32,926
我和童[童年]女神最近的一次接觸
Oh, well, the closest I've been to a child goddess

157
00:05:32,926 --> 00:05:35,296
就是我的女星茱兒·芭莉摩午餐盒
was my Drew Barrymore lunch box.

158
00:05:36,326 --> 00:05:37,896
老天 你們的房子好干凈
God, your house is so clean!

159
00:05:37,946 --> 00:05:39,616
你們有孩子是怎么讓它保持這么干凈的
How do you keep it so clean with kids?

160
00:05:39,616 --> 00:05:40,706
它們來啦
Here they are.

161
00:05:40,706 --> 00:05:42,376
這是德文和丹妮詩
This is Devon and Denise.

162
00:05:43,146 --> 00:05:44,886
這 這是你的 這就是你的孩子
Th-Those are your -- Those are your kids.

163
00:05:44,886 --> 00:05:46,416
老天 我又來了
Oh, my God. I did it again.

164
00:05:46,416 --> 00:05:48,766
我太習慣叫它們孩子了
I'm so used to calling them our kids,

165
00:05:48,766 --> 00:05:50,466
有的時候我忘記說清楚
sometimes I forget to clarify.

166
00:05:50,466 --> 00:05:51,346
沒事 沒關系
No. It's fine.

167
00:05:51,346 --> 00:05:53,395
德文可真是個小可愛啊
And isn't Devon just a little cutie?

168
00:05:53,395 --> 00:05:55,335
那是丹妮詩 她是有意思的那一個
That's Denise. She's the funny one.

169
00:05:55,335 --> 00:05:56,605
爸爸 我好無聊哦
Daddy, I'm bored.

170
00:05:56,605 --> 00:05:57,885
好了 這樣不禮貌 莉莉
Okay, that's not polite, Lily.

171
00:05:57,885 --> 00:05:59,225
稍安勿躁 小淑女
Now, hang on, little lady.

172
00:05:59,225 --> 00:06:01,305
我來給你找點樂子
I'm about to get your party started.

173
00:06:01,305 --> 00:06:05,125
這是一套斯里蘭卡買的手刻雙陸棋
This is a hand-carved backgammon set from Sri Lanka.

174
00:06:05,125 --> 00:06:06,685
用手套 好好玩吧
Use the gloves. Have fun.

175
00:06:06,685 --> 00:06:08,405
孩子們玩的時候
And while the kids are playing...

176
00:06:08,405 --> 00:06:09,325
或者噎著的時候
Or choking.

177
00:06:09,325 --> 00:06:10,525
不如你們和我們一起來廚房
...why don't you guys join us in the kitchen?

178
00:06:10,525 --> 00:06:11,545
我來拿點酒
I'll grab us some wine.

179
00:06:11,545 --> 00:06:13,015
我希望你不介意白葡萄酒
I hope you don't mind white.

180
00:06:13,015 --> 00:06:14,635
我們因為一次紅酒事件損失了一個沙發
We lost a couch to a Cabernet incident,

181
00:06:14,635 --> 00:06:16,425
特蘭特現在還有陰影
and Trent still gets flashbacks.

182
00:06:16,725 --> 00:06:18,185
好了 去玩吧 孩子們
Okay. Go have fun, kids.

183
00:06:18,185 --> 00:06:19,255
-好 -好好
- Yes! - Okay, okay.

184
00:06:19,255 --> 00:06:20,975
第一點 不能喝果汁
First of all, no drinking juice.

185
00:06:20,975 --> 00:06:22,136
讓我來從上到下檢查一遍
Let me pat him down.

186
00:06:22,145 --> 00:06:23,734
好了 讓我來檢查一下你
All right. Let me check you.

187
00:06:23,734 --> 00:06:24,754
好了 他沒問題
All right, he is clean.

188
00:06:24,754 --> 00:06:26,584
等等 這是什么
Wait. What is this?

189
00:06:26,944 --> 00:06:28,524
那東西怎么會在這
How did that get in there?

190
00:06:28,524 --> 00:06:30,324
好了 好了 聽著 你過來
Okay, okay, look. Hey, come here.

191
00:06:30,394 --> 00:06:32,674
坐在這 不要動
Just sit here. Do not move.

192
00:06:32,674 --> 00:06:34,624
你可以和德文... 妮詩玩
You can play with Devon...ise.

193
00:06:34,624 --> 00:06:36,124
你可以看你的卡車視頻
Uh, you can watch your truck videos.

194
00:06:36,124 --> 00:06:38,114
你 別讓他離開你的視線
Hey, don't take your eyes off of him.

195
00:06:38,114 --> 00:06:41,304
所以 確認一下 我不能有快樂童年嗎
So, just to be clear, I don't get any childhood?

196
00:06:41,304 --> 00:06:44,094
拜托 上周我們還教你怎么做果餡餅呢
Oh, please. Last week, we taught you how to make flan.

197
00:06:46,514 --> 00:06:47,434
是迪蘭
That's Dylan.

198
00:06:47,434 --> 00:06:48,924
你需要我留下嗎
You need me to stick around?

199
00:06:48,934 --> 00:06:51,304
不用 我剛剛在樓下練習該說什么
Nope. I was just downstairs practicing what to say,

200
00:06:51,304 --> 00:06:54,154
我準備好面對每種可能的情景了
and I am prepared for every possible scenario.

201
00:06:56,583 --> 00:06:57,534
來吧
Okay.

202
00:06:58,053 --> 00:06:59,803
-你好 親愛的 -不
- Hello, love! - Oh, no.

203
00:06:59,803 --> 00:07:01,513
我也想你 海莉
I missed you, too, Haley.

204
00:07:01,513 --> 00:07:02,923
大驚喜
Surprise!

205
00:07:02,933 --> 00:07:04,103
阿爾文從瑞士打電話給我
Arvin called me from Switzerland

206
00:07:04,103 --> 00:07:05,673
因為他想給你個驚喜
'cause he wanted to surprise you,

207
00:07:05,673 --> 00:07:07,213
所以我偷偷去機場把他接來了
so I snuck to the airport and picked him up.

208
00:07:07,213 --> 00:07:08,923
真不敢相信我們沒被發現
I can't believe we got away with it!

209
00:07:09,613 --> 00:07:12,293
-乖乖 又擊掌 -沒錯
- Oh, good. This again. - Yeah!

210
00:07:15,283 --> 00:07:16,824
-快進來 -快看我
- Uh, come inside! - Look at me!

211
00:07:17,073 --> 00:07:18,403
我去泡點茶
I'm gonna go make some tea!

212
00:07:18,403 --> 00:07:19,604
是啊 快看他
Yeah, look at him!

213
00:07:21,973 --> 00:07:23,503
不要接近那扇門
Get away from that door

214
00:07:23,503 --> 00:07:24,684
鄧菲先生
Oh, hey, Mr. Dunphy.

215
00:07:25,952 --> 00:07:27,233
你傷了我的"心"
You broke my heart.

216
00:07:36,092 --> 00:07:37,112
迪蘭
Look, Dylan --

217
00:07:37,112 --> 00:07:39,192
無需解釋 鄧非先生
No explanation necessary, Mr. D.

218
00:07:39,192 --> 00:07:41,182
假如你不得不對我動粗并將我挾持
If you had to rough me up and take me hostage,

219
00:07:41,182 --> 00:07:42,432
我相信你有充分的理由
I'm sure you had your reasons.

220
00:07:42,432 --> 00:07:44,992
好吧 迪蘭 我們得先談談你這扮相
Okay, Dylan, first, we have to talk about your costume.

221
00:07:44,992 --> 00:07:47,332
-你喜歡嗎 -非常棒
- Do you love it? - It's fantastic!

222
00:07:47,332 --> 00:07:49,132
但時機不能更糟了
But the timing couldn't be worse.

223
00:07:49,132 --> 00:07:51,382
-為什么 -你先坐
- Why? - Have a seat.

224
00:07:58,011 --> 00:07:59,572
還是站著吧
You know what? Standing's fine.

225
00:08:00,341 --> 00:08:03,441
聽著 阿爾文來了
Listen. Arvin's here.

226
00:08:03,581 --> 00:08:05,931
他從瑞士飛回來給海莉驚喜
He flew back from Switzerland to surprise Haley.

227
00:08:05,931 --> 00:08:08,971
我的對手也搞大示愛
I'm up against another grand gesture.

228
00:08:09,541 --> 00:08:10,891
他扮成什么了
What's he dressed as?

229
00:08:10,891 --> 00:08:12,921
他沒變裝 穿自己衣服來的
Nothing. Just-just himself.

230
00:08:13,351 --> 00:08:14,992
我覺得我勝算很大
I like my chances.

231
00:08:16,441 --> 00:08:18,271
我很抱歉沒回你電話
I'm sorry I didn't call you back.

232
00:08:18,271 --> 00:08:21,911
我只是需要時間來思考迪蘭這件事
I just needed time to process the whole Dylan thing.

233
00:08:21,911 --> 00:08:24,201
完全可以理解
That's totally understandable.

234
00:08:24,201 --> 00:08:26,171
媽 接下來交給我吧
Mom, got it from here.

235
00:08:26,171 --> 00:08:27,152
當然
Of course.

236
00:08:28,070 --> 00:08:29,371
我們真的嚇到她了對嗎
We really got her, huh?

237
00:08:29,610 --> 00:08:30,780
原諒我 我實在不想擊掌了
Forgive me. I can't anymore.

238
00:08:30,780 --> 00:08:33,030
-我做不到 -好的
- I just -- I can't. - Okay.

239
00:08:34,220 --> 00:08:36,060
海莉 我有話要告訴你
Haley, I need to tell you something.

240
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:38,301
我越過男女界限了
I transgressed.

241
00:08:38,350 --> 00:08:39,510
你從女人變成了男人嗎
You were a woman?

242
00:08:39,510 --> 00:08:40,760
不 不是
No. No.

243
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:42,890
在你告訴我那個吻的事后
After you told me about your kiss, um,

244
00:08:42,930 --> 00:08:46,260
我徑直去了其他科學家常光顧的酒吧
I headed straight to a pub frequented by other scientists

245
00:08:46,260 --> 00:08:48,410
長話短說
and, long story short,

246
00:08:48,510 --> 00:08:50,930
我吻了一個核物理學家
I kissed a nuclear physicist.

247
00:08:51,020 --> 00:08:52,310
我知道這話有些政治不正確
I know it's not PC to say,

248
00:08:52,310 --> 00:08:56,150
但他們還真是所有科學學科里最"隨便"的了
but they really are the loosest of the scientific disciplines.

249
00:08:56,270 --> 00:08:57,381
我原諒你
I forgive you.

250
00:08:57,810 --> 00:08:59,049
就這樣 這么快
Just like that, so fast?

251
00:08:59,049 --> 00:09:01,019
為什么不 我們同意彼此一樣有錯
Yeah. Why not? Let's just agree we're both equally guilty,

252
00:09:01,019 --> 00:09:02,620
向前看 永不再討論這件事吧
move on, and never talk about it again.

253
00:09:02,979 --> 00:09:05,099
聲明一下 我忍住了沒和她更進一步
For the record, it could have gone further.

254
00:09:05,099 --> 00:09:06,929
我希望你能為此夸我一下
I-I just want a little credit for that.

255
00:09:06,929 --> 00:09:07,950
好的
Okay.

256
00:09:11,349 --> 00:09:12,729
媽
Mom!

257
00:09:12,729 --> 00:09:13,699
怎么了
What?

258
00:09:13,699 --> 00:09:15,609
我每天三點都這樣做
I do this every day at 3:00.

259
00:09:29,019 --> 00:09:30,408
兄臺 你在做什么呢
Harpo, what are you doing?

260
00:09:30,638 --> 00:09:32,478
研究你 創造角色
Studying you, creating a character.

261
00:09:32,478 --> 00:09:33,558
你就假想我不在
Imagine I'm not here.

262
00:09:33,558 --> 00:09:34,748
我沒那么有想象力
I'm not that creative.

263
00:09:34,748 --> 00:09:36,468
不如你幫我一把實際離開
Maybe you could help me.

264
00:09:37,068 --> 00:09:39,038
真粗魯 我喜歡
So gruff. Love it.

265
00:09:39,038 --> 00:09:40,508
-我走 -我走
- I'm leaving. - I'm leaving.

266
00:09:40,508 --> 00:09:41,739
很好 你走
Good. You go.

267
00:09:42,328 --> 00:09:43,708
瞧瞧你們
Look at you,

268
00:09:43,708 --> 00:09:45,561
我的兩個好朋友
mis dos amigos!

269
00:09:45,582 --> 00:09:50,468
瞧瞧 瞧瞧你們 我的兩個好朋友
Look at-look at you, mis dos amigos!

270
00:09:50,468 --> 00:09:52,428
的確聽起來很像我
That does sound like me.

271
00:09:52,428 --> 00:09:54,648
你真有天賦
You're so talented.

272
00:09:55,048 --> 00:09:56,529
太奇怪了
Okay, that was strange.

273
00:09:56,548 --> 00:09:58,568
歌洛莉亞最討厭別人模仿她
Gloria hates when people imitate her.

274
00:09:58,568 --> 00:10:01,417
然后歌洛莉亞說"我的'爺'[鞋]哪去了
And then Gloria says, "Where are my 'chews'?

275
00:10:01,417 --> 00:10:03,517
沒有'爺'我怎么去俱樂部
I cannot go to the club without my 'chews.'

276
00:10:03,517 --> 00:10:06,127
你的傻狗把我的'爺'咬壞了"
Your stupid doggie chews my 'chews'!"

277
00:10:08,587 --> 00:10:09,758
很好笑
Ay, funny.

278
00:10:10,147 --> 00:10:13,377
曼尼 寶貝 來幫我揉揉腳踝
Manny, come rub my ankles, papi!

279
00:10:13,377 --> 00:10:13,977
很好
Good, good.

280
00:10:13,977 --> 00:10:18,687
不過你那個搞笑老頭的角色練得怎么樣了
But how is your funny old man character coming?

281
00:10:19,277 --> 00:10:20,567
誰給我倒杯威士忌
Somebody get me a scotch

282
00:10:20,567 --> 00:10:22,257
要和我的背痛一樣烈的
that's as stiff as my back.

283
00:10:22,887 --> 00:10:24,157
再學一次
Do that again!

284
00:10:24,157 --> 00:10:25,507
就靠這個發達了
That's the money!

285
00:10:25,507 --> 00:10:27,177
你怎么知道她在練這個
How did you know she was doing that?

286
00:10:27,177 --> 00:10:29,647
她特別支持我 這是她的主意
She is so supportive. It was her idea.

287
00:10:30,447 --> 00:10:31,697
原來如此
And there it was.

288
00:10:31,787 --> 00:10:34,546
歌洛莉亞和我一樣不喜歡那個怪胎住在家里
Gloria didn't want that weirdo here any more than I did.

289
00:10:34,546 --> 00:10:36,606
她只是希望我來做壞人
She just wanted me to be the bad guy.

290
00:10:36,606 --> 00:10:38,306
不過她可想得美
But the joke's on her,

291
00:10:38,306 --> 00:10:42,036
因為我可以很短暫地對他人很友好
because, for short bursts of time, I can be quite nice.

292
00:10:42,766 --> 00:10:44,676
我們在嘗試新的調味飯菜譜
We're trying out a new recipe for risotto.

293
00:10:44,676 --> 00:10:46,326
我們去托斯卡納找松露
We went truffle hunting in Tuscany,

294
00:10:46,326 --> 00:10:48,756
偷偷多夾帶回來一些
and we brought back a few more than we declared.

295
00:10:48,756 --> 00:10:52,836
你一個堂堂法院官員竟這么壞
Oh, and you, an officer of the court. So naughty.

296
00:10:52,836 --> 00:10:54,486
別擔心 我們沒那么死板
Don't worry. We're cool.

297
00:10:54,486 --> 00:10:56,756
我們的生發劑也是墨西哥弄回來的
We get our Propecia in Mexico.

298
00:10:58,276 --> 00:10:59,636
多跟我們說說托斯卡納的事
Tell us more about Tuscany.

299
00:10:59,636 --> 00:11:01,166
記得我們攢錢計劃去旅行嗎
Remember when we were saving up to go there?

300
00:11:01,166 --> 00:11:02,676
后來那筆錢用在什么上面了
What did we end up blowing that money on?

301
00:11:02,676 --> 00:11:03,825
-莉莉 -是啊
- Lily. - Right.

302
00:11:03,825 --> 00:11:06,415
你們的生活聽起來真多彩多姿
Oh, well, your life sounds so exciting.

303
00:11:06,795 --> 00:11:09,435
你們的房子這么漂亮 全是好東西
Your house is so beautiful, with such nice things.

304
00:11:09,435 --> 00:11:11,075
他們不需要把錢花在牙齒矯正
Well, they don't have to spend their money on orthodontia,

305
00:11:11,075 --> 00:11:12,935
-芭蕾課和大學基金上 -是啊
- ballet lessons, and college funds. - Yeah.

306
00:11:12,935 --> 00:11:14,055
這山望著那山高
The grass is greener.

307
00:11:14,055 --> 00:11:15,175
你們的山的確更高
Your grass is greener.

308
00:11:15,175 --> 00:11:17,505
我們都沒辦法讓卡爾在家里尿尿
We can't seem to get Cal to pee indoors.

309
00:11:17,505 --> 00:11:18,695
你的家庭看起來很美好
Well, your family seems great.

310
00:11:18,695 --> 00:11:20,945
米奇爾在單位也鋒芒畢露
And, Mitchell, you are killing it at the office.

311
00:11:20,945 --> 00:11:21,775
真的嗎
Really?

312
00:11:21,775 --> 00:11:23,745
因為我覺得我接到的
Because I-I feel like I'm kind of getting

313
00:11:23,745 --> 00:11:26,315
都是不起眼 入門級的官司
more low-profile, starter cases.

314
00:11:26,315 --> 00:11:27,455
我要是你就不會擔心
Uh, I wouldn't worry about that.

315
00:11:27,455 --> 00:11:29,805
其實我最近接了一起大官司
There's actually a big case that I am working on,

316
00:11:29,805 --> 00:11:31,545
我認為你...
I think you will --

317
00:11:31,615 --> 00:11:32,575
我的天
Oh, my God.

318
00:11:32,575 --> 00:11:34,315
-什么聲音 -快去
- What was that?! - Go! Go!

319
00:11:34,315 --> 00:11:35,895
拜托千萬是他家孩子惹的禍
Please let it be one of their kids.

320
00:11:36,804 --> 00:11:38,174
你們在這呢
There you are!

321
00:11:38,424 --> 00:11:40,804
海莉 你有空嗎
Hey. Uh, Haley, do you have a sec?

322
00:11:40,804 --> 00:11:42,994
你不介意的話 我倆有點脫不開身
If you don't mind, we were kind of in the middle of something.

323
00:11:42,994 --> 00:11:46,454
菲爾 你為什么要打擾他們倆
Phil, what are you doing intruding on these two?

324
00:11:46,744 --> 00:11:48,714
我辦公室里有樣東西得給海莉看看
I just need to show Haley something in my office.

325
00:11:48,714 --> 00:11:50,964
我剛才在打掃 偶然看到一個舊娃娃
I was doing a little cleaning, and I came across this old doll

326
00:11:50,964 --> 00:11:53,234
過去她特別喜歡
that used to mean a lot to her.

327
00:11:53,234 --> 00:11:55,164
你不能直接處理掉它嗎
Can't you just get rid of the doll?

328
00:11:55,164 --> 00:11:56,724
本來要處理 但我真的認為
I started to, but it really seems like

329
00:11:56,724 --> 00:11:59,304
你該自己去 有個了結
something you should do, you know, for closure.

330
00:12:01,114 --> 00:12:02,155
你說得對
You're right.

331
00:12:02,184 --> 00:12:04,804
等等 娃娃還需要了結嗎
Wait. You need closure from a doll?

332
00:12:04,804 --> 00:12:05,734
感覺有點怪
That seems odd.

333
00:12:05,734 --> 00:12:08,113
畢竟我16歲起就和那個娃娃一起睡了
Well, I did sleep with that thing since I was like 16.

334
00:12:10,053 --> 00:12:11,274
不
Oh, no.

335
00:12:13,003 --> 00:12:14,044
迪蘭
Dylan.

336
00:12:14,403 --> 00:12:16,443
迪蘭怎么會在這
What is Dylan doing here?

337
00:12:16,443 --> 00:12:17,823
他來搞大示愛
He's making a grand gesture.

338
00:12:17,823 --> 00:12:19,513
不和海莉談談他不肯走
He won't leave until he talks to Haley.

339
00:12:19,513 --> 00:12:21,813
我的天 不過是一個吻而已
Oh, my God. It was one kiss.

340
00:12:22,043 --> 00:12:23,763
又傻又天真的克萊爾
Poor, naive Claire.

341
00:12:23,763 --> 00:12:25,403
是兩個吻
It was two kisses.

342
00:12:25,403 --> 00:12:26,613
你是怎么摻和進來的
You have something to do with this?

343
00:12:26,613 --> 00:12:27,983
海莉一直對他玩人間蒸發
Haley was ghosting him.

344
00:12:27,983 --> 00:12:28,753
那是什么意思
What does that mean?

345
00:12:28,753 --> 00:12:30,403
你也太不潮了
You are so not hip.

346
00:12:30,773 --> 00:12:32,013
她不肯回他電話
She wouldn't call him back,

347
00:12:32,013 --> 00:12:33,503
所以我叫她做正確的事
so I told her to do the right thing

348
00:12:33,503 --> 00:12:35,763
當面有個了結 或者隨便怎樣
and end it -- or whatever -- in person.

349
00:12:35,763 --> 00:12:37,442
"隨便怎樣" 那可不行
"Or whatever"? No "Or whatever."

350
00:12:37,442 --> 00:12:39,932
她從青春期起就"隨便怎樣"了
She's been "Or whatever-ing" since puberty.

351
00:12:39,932 --> 00:12:42,142
她是時候成熟起來了
It is time for her to grow up.

352
00:12:42,532 --> 00:12:43,422
無所謂
Doesn't matter. Look,

353
00:12:43,422 --> 00:12:45,932
歸根結底我們對她的期望是一樣的
we both want the same thing for her in the end.

354
00:12:45,932 --> 00:12:47,093
-絕對的 -沒錯
- Absolutely. - Right.

355
00:12:47,162 --> 00:12:48,552
讓她自己做出選擇
For her to make her own decision.

356
00:12:48,552 --> 00:12:51,352
當然 唯一的選擇是 阿爾文
Of course. The only decision is...Arvin.

357
00:12:51,352 --> 00:12:53,382
我同意 阿爾文很出眾
I agree. Arvin is very impressive.

358
00:12:53,382 --> 00:12:55,182
但你該知道迪蘭最近
But you should know Dylan has been

359
00:12:55,182 --> 00:12:57,042
在勤勉地讀護理學院
putting himself through nursing school,

360
00:12:57,042 --> 00:12:59,982
在醫院工作 跑步
working at the hospital, running.

361
00:13:00,282 --> 00:13:02,052
別告訴我你是真心在維護那家伙
You're not honestly making a case for that guy?

362
00:13:02,052 --> 00:13:03,752
那家伙會為海莉出生入死
That guy would take a bullet for Haley.

363
00:13:03,752 --> 00:13:05,242
你為什么對他感情這么深
Why are you so invested in him?

364
00:13:05,242 --> 00:13:06,602
因為我當年和他一樣
Because I was that guy!

365
00:13:06,602 --> 00:13:08,911
我不管喜歡哪個女孩都配不上人家
I was the underdog with every girl I ever liked.

366
00:13:09,161 --> 00:13:10,272
真窩心
That's very sweet.

367
00:13:10,681 --> 00:13:12,021
可重點不在于你
But this isn't about you.

368
00:13:12,021 --> 00:13:13,851
重點在于海莉
This is about Haley

369
00:13:14,011 --> 00:13:17,671
是選擇受人尊敬 有魅力的科學家
being with a respected, charming scientist

370
00:13:17,671 --> 00:13:20,961
還是選擇在莉莉哄騙下吃掉一盒蠟筆的家伙
versus a guy who Lily convinced to eat a box of crayons.

371
00:13:20,961 --> 00:13:22,291
他只咬了一支蠟筆一口
It was one bite out of one crayon.

372
00:13:22,291 --> 00:13:23,771
還是因為他被蒙著眼睛
It was only because he was blindfolded

373
00:13:23,771 --> 00:13:25,841
手指又被手指鎖鎖住了
and trapped in a Chinese finger puzzle.

374
00:13:27,371 --> 00:13:29,531
我不知道阿爾文會來
I had no idea Arvin was going to be here,

375
00:13:29,531 --> 00:13:31,531
但我們改天再談好嗎
but can we please do this another time?

376
00:13:31,531 --> 00:13:34,371
改天我就沒有這身裝扮了 海莉
I won't have the costume another time, Haley.

377
00:13:34,391 --> 00:13:38,441
這就是陪你睡了多年的娃娃[美男]
So, this is the doll you slept with.

378
00:13:38,441 --> 00:13:40,600
你也長得挺好看的
Hey, you're pretty handsome yourself.

379
00:13:42,050 --> 00:13:44,570
我有太多問題了
So many questions.

380
00:13:44,610 --> 00:13:47,530
第一 你要是因為吻他而難過
First -- why have you snuck 'round to see the bloke

381
00:13:47,530 --> 00:13:50,140
又為什么偷偷摸摸見他
you supposedly feel terrible about kissing?

382
00:13:50,140 --> 00:13:52,720
我不是炫耀 但大多數情況下
Yo, I hope this doesn't sound braggy, but for the most part,

383
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:55,230
人們吻過我后一點都不難過
people do not feel terrible about kissing me.

384
00:13:55,230 --> 00:13:56,600
你們倆打住
Okay, guys, stop.

385
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:59,760
聽好了 這位好傻好天真的朋友
Listen to me, my simple friend.

386
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:02,090
我剛坐了14小時飛機中間排的位子
I just spent 14 hours in a middle seat.

387
00:14:02,090 --> 00:14:04,190
我勸你最好別擋老子的道
I suggest you get out of my space.

388
00:14:04,190 --> 00:14:07,140
我還要建議你下次去做有逃生門那排呢
Well, I suggest, next time, you ask about an exit row.

389
00:14:07,140 --> 00:14:10,410
雖然還是可能得做到中間排 但好歹夠伸腿
It could still be a middle seat, but you'd have more leg room.

390
00:14:10,410 --> 00:14:11,500
你給我走
You have to go!

391
00:14:14,019 --> 00:14:17,199
夠了 停止打架或者隨便怎樣
Enough! Stop fighting or whatever this is.

392
00:14:17,199 --> 00:14:18,760
阿爾文 你在這里啊
Arvin! There you are!

393
00:14:20,479 --> 00:14:21,410
你也好啊 迪蘭
Oh. Hi, Dylan.

394
00:14:21,439 --> 00:14:23,329
如往常一般容光煥發啊 鄧菲太太
Radiant as ever, Mrs. D.

395
00:14:23,979 --> 00:14:25,399
海莉 趕緊讓他滾啊
Haley, tell him to leave.

396
00:14:25,399 --> 00:14:27,039
我來試試緩解這場面吧
Let me see if I can defuse the situation.

397
00:14:27,039 --> 00:14:29,299
媽 老爸 別再插手我的人生
Mom, Dad, stop meddling in my life.

398
00:14:29,299 --> 00:14:30,459
現在都出去
Outside now!

399
00:14:30,459 --> 00:14:31,509
-行吧 -立刻
- All right. - Now!

400
00:14:31,509 --> 00:14:32,799
好好好
Okay. Okay.

401
00:14:34,969 --> 00:14:36,319
快幫忙 我不知道該怎么辦了
Help me. I don't know what to do.

402
00:14:38,079 --> 00:14:39,369
我的面具
My mask!

403
00:14:39,369 --> 00:14:41,129
我們真的超級對不起
We are so, so sorry.

404
00:14:41,129 --> 00:14:42,338
我試過要擋住他了
I tried to block him.

405
00:14:42,338 --> 00:14:44,108
他假動作騙我去救玻璃青蛙了
He faked going for the glass frog.

406
00:14:44,108 --> 00:14:45,438
我真不敢相信
I can't believe it.

407
00:14:45,438 --> 00:14:47,268
深呼吸 寶貝 深呼吸
Breathe, honey. Breathe.

408
00:14:47,828 --> 00:14:48,698
我們能修好嗎
Can we fix it?

409
00:14:48,698 --> 00:14:50,258
不一定啊 你有沒有非洲第一高峰上
Oh, I don't know. Do you happen to have any clay

410
00:14:50,258 --> 00:14:51,978
因融雪而成的黏土呢
from the melted runoff of Kilimanjaro?

411
00:14:51,978 --> 00:14:53,579
因為它就是用這材料做的
Because that's what it's made of!

412
00:14:53,618 --> 00:14:55,438
這是我們第一次去坦桑尼亞時得到的
We got it on our first trip to Tanzania.

413
00:14:55,438 --> 00:14:57,958
被治好他牛皮癬的薩滿所加持過
It was blessed by the shaman that healed his psoriasis.

414
00:14:57,958 --> 00:15:00,008
我們很樂意去找替代品補償你的損失
Of course we'll be happy to pay to replace it.

415
00:15:00,008 --> 00:15:01,409
這東西無可替代
It's irreplaceable!

416
00:15:01,918 --> 00:15:02,909
天啊
Oh, my God.

417
00:15:03,238 --> 00:15:04,948
又開始發作了
It's back. Oh.

418
00:15:05,588 --> 00:15:07,678
我們真覺得道再多歉也不夠
We cannot apologize enough.

419
00:15:07,678 --> 00:15:08,909
這話可能還真說對了
That's probably true.

420
00:15:09,008 --> 00:15:10,239
我去弄午飯
I'll go get lunch.

421
00:15:10,978 --> 00:15:12,238
慘了 這真的很糟糕
Okay, this is a disaster.

422
00:15:12,238 --> 00:15:14,207
但你可還有留意到他有提起
I know, but is any part of you still hearing

423
00:15:14,207 --> 00:15:15,667
"第一次去坦桑尼亞時"
"first trip to Tanzania"?

424
00:15:15,667 --> 00:15:17,647
他就差一點就要把那個案子給我了
He was just about to offer me the case I want.

425
00:15:17,647 --> 00:15:18,508
沒事 以后還會有別的案子
Well, there'll be other cases.

426
00:15:20,257 --> 00:15:22,287
一個高級伴游 還有非法武器銷售
an escort, and illegal arms sales, okay?

427
00:15:22,287 --> 00:15:23,897
我想要將他們繩之以法
I want to bring them to justice.

428
00:15:23,897 --> 00:15:25,337
而且他們已經賣出了電影翻拍版權
Plus, they've already sold the movie rights.

429
00:15:25,337 --> 00:15:27,137
有可能會是帥哥男星瑞恩·高斯林演我呢
I could be played by Ryan Gosling.

430
00:15:27,137 --> 00:15:28,457
是是是 親愛的 要胸懷大志
That's it, honey. Aim high.

431
00:15:28,457 --> 00:15:29,857
天啊 這下怎么辦
Oh, my God. What can we do?

432
00:15:29,857 --> 00:15:30,838
我們該怎么解釋
What can we do?

433
00:15:34,487 --> 00:15:36,847
-快點 快咬我腳踝 -你說什么
- Quick. Bite my ankle. - Excuse me?

434
00:15:36,847 --> 00:15:38,297
快點 趁他們回來之前咬 這樣我就能說
Hurry, before they come back. I'm gonna tell them

435
00:15:38,297 --> 00:15:40,067
是狗咬了我 這樣面具的事就能抵消了
the dog did it. It'll cancel out the mask.

436
00:15:40,067 --> 00:15:41,038
快咬
Just do it.

437
00:15:41,617 --> 00:15:42,867
大力點 得留下傷痕
Harder. It needs to scar me.

438
00:15:42,867 --> 00:15:44,386
這絕對給我心靈留下了傷痕
It's definitely scarring me.

439
00:15:44,386 --> 00:15:45,927
得讓他們相信是狗咬的
They need to believe a dog did it.

440
00:15:50,116 --> 00:15:51,236
這個嘛... 如果你們...
Oh. Well, if you're --

441
00:15:51,236 --> 00:15:52,586
如果你們午飯要讓我們等這么久
you're gonna make us wait so long to eat,

442
00:15:52,586 --> 00:15:55,426
看到這一幕也不算什么奇怪的事吧
this shouldn't come as a surprise.

443
00:15:56,946 --> 00:15:58,296
歌洛莉亞 快來看
Gloria, come here!

444
00:15:58,296 --> 00:16:00,826
你一定得來看 她太出色了
You got to see this. She's on fire.

445
00:16:00,826 --> 00:16:01,896
你快瞧瞧
Now, check this out.

446
00:16:01,896 --> 00:16:03,796
我能給她出任何題
I can throw anything at her,

447
00:16:03,796 --> 00:16:06,226
她都能瞬間演得超爆笑
and she can make comedy gold out of it.

448
00:16:06,266 --> 00:16:07,047
來
Here. Um...

449
00:16:07,636 --> 00:16:10,006
約翰·特拉沃爾塔在潛水艇里
John Travolta in a submarine.

450
00:16:13,556 --> 00:16:16,645
懂了吧 因為潛艇里很狹窄
Yeah, because a submarine is small.

451
00:16:16,645 --> 00:16:18,935
歌洛莉亞你說得真對 她超搞笑
You were right, Gloria. She's hilarious.

452
00:16:18,935 --> 00:16:20,066
再來一題吧
Do another one. Um...

453
00:16:21,175 --> 00:16:24,205
霸王龍打排球
T. Rex in a volleyball game.

454
00:16:26,565 --> 00:16:27,656
你看看
Look at that.

455
00:16:28,045 --> 00:16:30,445
霸王龍的小短手很難殺球
It's hard to spike with little arms.

456
00:16:30,445 --> 00:16:32,725
杰 能借一步說話嗎
Jay, can I talk to you in there for a second?

457
00:16:32,725 --> 00:16:33,965
行行行 沒問題
Yeah, yeah. All right.

458
00:16:33,965 --> 00:16:35,286
我馬上回來
I'll be right back.

459
00:16:35,635 --> 00:16:36,836
太好笑了
What a hoot!

460
00:16:37,145 --> 00:16:38,455
你耍什么陰招呢 老鬼
What is your game, old man?

461
00:16:38,455 --> 00:16:40,085
沒招啊 我超喜歡
Nothing. I'm loving this.

462
00:16:40,085 --> 00:16:42,885
我現在只怕她哪天火了會想搬走
My only fear is that she might hit it big and leave us.

463
00:16:42,885 --> 00:16:43,775
你當我傻啊
You think I'm an idiot?

464
00:16:43,775 --> 00:16:46,095
沒人會覺得剛才的表演好笑
Nobody thinks that that is funny.

465
00:16:46,095 --> 00:16:48,624
你說實話 你明明比我更想要她滾蛋
Be honest -- you want her out of here more than I do.

466
00:16:48,624 --> 00:16:50,594
行 但我不想當那種
Okay, fine, but I don't want to be the mother

467
00:16:50,594 --> 00:16:52,524
討厭自己兒子女朋友的媽媽
that hates her son's girlfriends.

468
00:16:52,524 --> 00:16:53,934
我也不想再當家里那個壞人了
I don't want to be the villain anymore.

469
00:16:53,934 --> 00:16:55,094
但這是你的職責啊
But that's your job.

470
00:16:55,094 --> 00:16:57,574
我是負責安靜有趣的母親
I am the quiet and fun one.

471
00:16:57,574 --> 00:16:59,374
你是沒看到她模仿你的樣子嗎
Have you not heard her impression of you?

472
00:16:59,374 --> 00:17:00,264
像到爆炸
It's dead-on.

473
00:17:00,264 --> 00:17:01,844
你想把她趕走你就自己動手
You want to get rid of her, you do it.

474
00:17:01,844 --> 00:17:04,154
不需要 因為我假裝喜歡她的持續力
I won't have to, because I can pretend

475
00:17:04,154 --> 00:17:07,264
將會比你長很多
that I like Sherry longer than you can.

476
00:17:07,264 --> 00:17:09,194
你會先受不了的
You will crack first.

477
00:17:09,194 --> 00:17:10,964
你會先受不了的
You will crack first!

478
00:17:10,964 --> 00:17:13,024
雪莉 你不能住這里了
Sherry, you cannot stay here.

479
00:17:13,024 --> 00:17:14,434
什么 為什么啊
What? Why?

480
00:17:14,434 --> 00:17:16,794
因為你快把我逼瘋了
Because you're driving me crazy.

481
00:17:16,794 --> 00:17:18,053
我還以為你挺喜歡我呢
But I thought you liked me.

482
00:17:18,053 --> 00:17:19,873
孩子 我也不知道說什么 她很難相處
What can I say, kid? She's rough.

483
00:17:19,873 --> 00:17:21,194
我去幫你拿行李
Let me get your bag.

484
00:17:21,373 --> 00:17:22,983
我回來啦 你們猜怎么著
Hey, I'm back! Guess what.

485
00:17:22,983 --> 00:17:25,063
我以前幫主任寫的那些書法有回報了
All that calligraphy I've done for the dean paid off.

486
00:17:25,063 --> 00:17:26,243
他說我可以跟你住一起了
He said you can stay with me.

487
00:17:26,243 --> 00:17:28,423
你媽媽剛說她討厭我
Your mom just told me she hates me.

488
00:17:29,083 --> 00:17:30,573
媽 你為什么會說這種話
Mom, why would you say that?

489
00:17:32,073 --> 00:17:33,703
落幕
And scene!

490
00:17:34,763 --> 00:17:36,463
為什么我不能叫迪蘭走
Why can't I tell Dylan to leave?

491
00:17:36,463 --> 00:17:41,263
因為你對你人生首次真心成熟
Because you are scared of the first real, adult relationship

492
00:17:41,263 --> 00:17:44,233
對象還完美的戀情感到惶恐 所以想躲回舊愛
with the perfect man, and you're clinging to the past.

493
00:17:44,233 --> 00:17:46,363
也可能你跟迪蘭有著十分特別的緣分
Or you and Dylan have a special connection

494
00:17:46,363 --> 00:17:47,553
而且你還愛著他
and you still love him.

495
00:17:47,553 --> 00:17:48,532
完全沒幫到我
Not helping.

496
00:17:48,532 --> 00:17:50,412
天啊 他們倆都是很好的男人
God, they're both such great guys,

497
00:17:50,412 --> 00:17:51,432
但型真的好不一樣
but they're so different.

498
00:17:51,432 --> 00:17:53,312
我到底該怎么選啊
How am I supposed to choose?

499
00:17:53,312 --> 00:17:54,562
你們當時怎么選中彼此的
How did you guys do it?

500
00:17:54,562 --> 00:17:55,952
乖女兒 我...
Well, sweetheart, I --

501
00:17:56,402 --> 00:17:57,742
這題我真是幫不上你了
I'm not gonna be any help here.

502
00:17:57,742 --> 00:18:00,632
從我見到你媽媽的那一秒 我就拋棄了選擇
From the minute I met your mom, there was no choice.

503
00:18:00,632 --> 00:18:02,612
她聰明又堅強
She was smart. She was strong.

504
00:18:02,912 --> 00:18:05,662
她對父親的怨恨恰好夠愛上我這樣的人
She resented her father just enough to go for a guy like me.

505
00:18:05,662 --> 00:18:08,352
她... 她讓我的人生得到了平衡
She -- She gave my life balance,

506
00:18:08,352 --> 00:18:09,922
我現在早已無法想象失去她會如何
and now I can't imagine it without her.

507
00:18:09,922 --> 00:18:11,013
而且她...
Also, she's --

508
00:18:11,412 --> 00:18:12,853
真的長得超正
she's crazy hot.

509
00:18:13,872 --> 00:18:14,622
老媽
Mom?

510
00:18:14,622 --> 00:18:15,703
首先呢
Well, first of all, um,

511
00:18:15,902 --> 00:18:18,632
我對能說出剛才那種話的男人沒抵抗力
I'm a sucker for guys who say things like that.

512
00:18:19,901 --> 00:18:22,461
你爸爸是我見過人最好 最積極正面的人
Your dad is the nicest, most positive person I know,

513
00:18:22,461 --> 00:18:24,521
他總能幫我找到生命中的那些歡樂
and he always helps me find the fun in life.

514
00:18:24,521 --> 00:18:28,201
而且他... 現在看起來還是超順眼的呢
And, uh, he is still real easy on the peepers.

515
00:18:28,831 --> 00:18:29,761
我們真的很幸運呢
Aww. We really are lucky.

516
00:18:29,761 --> 00:18:30,991
對啊
Oh, I know.

517
00:18:30,991 --> 00:18:33,261
我都忘了我們剛才在吵什么了
I forgot what we were even fighting about.

518
00:18:33,261 --> 00:18:34,402
我也是
Me too.

519
00:18:34,571 --> 00:18:36,351
你們沒在吵架 剛才是在討論我的煩惱
You weren't fighting. We were talking about my problem.

520
00:18:36,351 --> 00:18:38,231
-對哦 -親愛的
- Oh, yeah. - Oh, honey,

521
00:18:38,341 --> 00:18:40,391
你最好還是忘了我們說的那些話
you should probably just ignore everything we said

522
00:18:40,391 --> 00:18:43,891
然后想象分別與他們在一起的人生會如何
and try to imagine your life with each of them.

523
00:18:44,001 --> 00:18:45,062
你能看到什么畫面
What do you see?

524
00:18:47,261 --> 00:18:51,530
跟阿爾文在一起 能預見到又大又漂亮的房子
I guess, with Arvin, I see a big, beautiful house...

525
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:52,751
阿爾文
Arvin!

526
00:18:53,570 --> 00:18:54,571
阿爾文你等等我
Arvin, wait!

527
00:18:54,830 --> 00:18:56,130
房子里擺滿了各種書籍
...lined with books,

528
00:18:56,130 --> 00:18:58,440
有趣的人們來家里拜訪
interesting people coming in and out,

529
00:18:58,730 --> 00:19:01,260
與一個出色的男人一起養大孩子
raising kids with a brilliant man.

530
00:19:01,980 --> 00:19:03,850
我真的很對不起 我...
I'm so sorry. I...

531
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:05,041
沒事啦
Oh, well.

532
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:08,330
現在我可能得用我的聰明才智干壞事了
Now I may have to use my genius for evil.

533
00:19:08,380 --> 00:19:10,080
而你就是我的惡人黑化起源
You're my origin story.

534
00:19:10,650 --> 00:19:11,591
什么
What?

535
00:19:11,730 --> 00:19:14,360
每個超級壞蛋都有個令他們那么...
Every supervillain has a reason they're so...

536
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:17,880
算了 或許這樣最好
You know, maybe this is for the best.

537
00:19:19,430 --> 00:19:22,909
與迪蘭在一起呢 我能預見
With Dylan, I see us in a cute, little place

538
00:19:22,909 --> 00:19:25,239
我們小而溫馨 但需要努力改善的家
that needs a ton of work.

539
00:19:26,509 --> 00:19:28,569
我們或許沒辦法擁有各種最好的東西
We may not have all the nicest things,

540
00:19:28,569 --> 00:19:32,019
但永遠會有音樂與歡聲笑語
but there's music and laughing,

541
00:19:32,159 --> 00:19:34,339
而且我知道我能永遠當自己
and I know I can always be myself,

542
00:19:34,879 --> 00:19:36,599
他也會永遠愛真正的我
and he'll always love me for it.

543
00:19:39,109 --> 00:19:41,599
我剛剛結束一段戀情
I just got out of a relationship.

544
00:19:42,219 --> 00:19:44,089
我現在真的是一團亂
I'm, like, a complete mess.

545
00:19:44,729 --> 00:19:47,499
那太好了 我就喜歡一團亂
That's perfect. I love messes.

546
00:19:48,049 --> 00:19:50,719
我們能不能... 退后一步
Can we, uh, take a step back

547
00:19:50,719 --> 00:19:52,419
就單純從約個會開始
and just go out on a date?

548
00:19:52,419 --> 00:19:53,389
沒問題
Sure.

549
00:19:54,088 --> 00:19:55,349
座駕已在此等候多時
Your chariot awaits.

550
00:19:56,118 --> 00:19:58,548
我這樣坐不進我的車嘛
I couldn't fit in my car, you know.

551
00:20:01,438 --> 00:20:02,788
好 我就先...
Okay, I'll just -- Oh!

552
00:20:05,358 --> 00:20:07,828
我們倆看來是永遠也別想退休了吧
We're never gonna be able to retire, are we?

553
00:20:07,968 --> 00:20:08,889
別想了
Nope.

554
00:20:18,408 --> 00:20:20,178
很遺憾那個很有料的案子沒到手
Ah. I'm sorry the juicy trial didn't work out.

555
00:20:20,178 --> 00:20:21,158
你還好嗎
Are you okay?

556
00:20:21,158 --> 00:20:23,608
如果我能有機會重來
Yeah. I-I guess if I had to do it all over again,

557
00:20:23,608 --> 00:20:25,157
我不會再叫你咬我
I wouldn't have told you to bite me.

558
00:20:25,157 --> 00:20:28,247
好奇怪啊 我居然什么都沒問就去咬了
Weird how I just went along with that, no questions.

559
00:20:28,517 --> 00:20:30,357
說到有機會重來
And speaking of doing it all over again,

560
00:20:30,587 --> 00:20:32,137
你有后悔過要孩子嗎
do you ever regret having kids?

561
00:20:32,137 --> 00:20:33,477
當然不啦
Of course not.

562
00:20:33,477 --> 00:20:35,537
這么說吧 我有過回想過去
I mean, do I sometimes look back

563
00:20:35,537 --> 00:20:37,157
然后希望一切與現在不同嗎
and wish everything was different?

564
00:20:37,157 --> 00:20:38,657
如果你的答案是"有" 那就是有后悔
If you say "yes," that is regret.

565
00:20:38,657 --> 00:20:41,777
那沒有 因為如果沒有孩子們
Then, no, because if we didn't have them

566
00:20:41,777 --> 00:20:43,307
我會變成像特倫特 一個緊張兮兮的神經病
I would be Trent, an uptight lunatic

567
00:20:43,307 --> 00:20:46,807
會因為一個小飾物壞了就崩潰
who falls apart over a broken tchotchke.

568
00:20:46,807 --> 00:20:48,897
孩子們能開拓你的視野
I mean, kids give you perspective.

569
00:20:48,897 --> 00:20:50,557
讓你理解什么才是真正重要的東西
You realize what's important,

570
00:20:50,557 --> 00:20:52,607
讓你能放開那些...
to let go of...

571
00:20:53,247 --> 00:20:55,456
我們家最后的好東西也碎了
And there goes our last nice thing.

572
00:20:55,956 --> 00:20:57,497
感謝老天給了我們一個解脫
Thank God we're free now.
